{"id":"03-jagged","number":3,"slug":"what-agents-are-good-at","title":"What agents are great at, and where they fail","short":"Where agents shine and fail","module":"The shift","summary":"Agent intelligence is jagged: superhuman on some tasks, baffling on others. The pattern isn't random. Agents fly where results are easy to verify and stumble on judgment, design and long, unchecked runs. Learn to delegate by verifiability.","voice":"Eric","scenes":[{"template":"title","chapter":"Intro","narration":"Agents are brilliant and baffling, often in the same hour. That's not random. Once you see the pattern, you'll know what to hand off and what to keep.","params":{"kicker":"Lesson 3","module":"Module 1 · The shift","title":"What agents are *great* at, and where they fail","subtitle":"Jagged intelligence, and how to delegate around it.","bubble":"I'm a genius. Mostly.","mood":"think"},"start":0.5,"dur":10.839,"words":[{"text":"Agents","s":0.8,"e":1.28},{"text":"are","s":1.4,"e":1.52},{"text":"brilliant","s":1.64,"e":2.24},{"text":"and","s":2.32,"e":2.56},{"text":"baffling,","s":2.64,"e":3.52},{"text":"often","s":3.6,"e":3.92},{"text":"in","s":3.96,"e":4},{"text":"the","s":4.08,"e":4.16},{"text":"same","s":4.28,"e":4.4},{"text":"hour.","s":4.48,"e":5.04},{"text":"That's","s":5.28,"e":5.48},{"text":"not","s":5.52,"e":5.68},{"text":"random.","s":5.76,"e":6.52},{"text":"Once","s":6.8,"e":6.96},{"text":"you","s":7.04,"e":7.12},{"text":"see","s":7.2,"e":7.28},{"text":"the","s":7.32,"e":7.36},{"text":"pattern,","s":7.44,"e":8.08},{"text":"you'll","s":8.12,"e":8.32},{"text":"know","s":8.4,"e":8.48},{"text":"what","s":8.56,"e":8.64},{"text":"to","s":8.72,"e":8.8},{"text":"hand","s":8.92,"e":9.04},{"text":"off","s":9.12,"e":9.36},{"text":"and","s":9.44,"e":9.6},{"text":"what","s":9.68,"e":9.76},{"text":"to","s":9.8,"e":9.84},{"text":"keep.","s":9.92,"e":10.48}]},{"template":"quote","chapter":"Jagged intelligence","narration":"Karpathy describes the paradox. A state of the art model 