},{"text":"it,","s":52.341,"e":52.821},{"text":"if","s":52.901,"e":52.981},{"text":"you","s":53.021,"e":53.061},{"text":"design","s":53.141,"e":53.461},{"text":"it","s":53.541,"e":53.621},{"text":"right,","s":53.741,"e":54.101},{"text":"you","s":54.181,"e":54.261},{"text":"have","s":54.301,"e":54.341},{"text":"a","s":54.421,"e":54.581},{"text":"perfect","s":54.781,"e":54.981},{"text":"loop.","s":55.061,"e":55.861},{"text":"That's","s":55.941,"e":56.101},{"text":"why","s":56.181,"e":56.261},{"text":"coding","s":56.341,"e":56.661},{"text":"agents","s":56.821,"e":56.981},{"text":"arrived","s":57.061,"e":57.381},{"text":"before","s":57.461,"e":57.861},{"text":"agents","s":58.061,"e":58.261},{"text":"for","s":58.341,"e":58.421},{"text":"almost","s":58.501,"e":58.821},{"text":"anything","s":58.901,"e":59.221},{"text":"else.","s":59.301,"e":59.941}]},{"template":"list","chapter":"Where agents fly","narration":"So agents fly on work with a fast, clear check. Reading and explaining a large codebase. Fixing a bug you can reproduce with a failing test. Migrations where the old tests define the target. Boilerplate, scripts and prototypes, where a wrong answer is cheap.","params":{"title":"Where agents fly","items":[{"text":"Reading and explaining big codebases","at":"reading"},{"text":"Bugs you can reproduce with a test","at":"bug"},{"text":"Migrations with tests as the target","at":"migrations"},{"text":"Boilerplate, scripts, prototypes","sub":"wrong answers are cheap","at":"boilerplate"}]},"start":60.557,"dur":18.426,"words":[{"text":"So","s":60.857,"e":61.017},{"text":"agents","s":61.097,"e":61.497},{"text":"fly","s":61.577,"e":61.737},{"text":"on","s":61.817,"e":61.977},{"text":"work","s":62.137,"e":62.297},{"text":"with","s":62.377,"e":62.457},{"text":"a","s":62.537,"e":62.617},{"text":"fast,","s":62.697,"e":63.257},{"text":"clear","s":63.417,"e":63.577},{"text":"check.","s":63.657,"e":64.057},{"text":"Reading","s":64.937,"e":65.017},{"text":"and","s":65.097,"e":65.257},{"